                <div align="center"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b> 
                  CNN ignores new footage showing IDF deliberate firing on civilians 
                  in Jenin market</b></font></div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
              <td height="2"> 
                <hr height="1" size="1">
